      <h1>Memory contract prices in 4Q26: what rising DRAM and NAND costs mean for PCBA</h1>
      <div class="ins-byline"><span class="who">Hana Engineering Team</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span><span>Published 8 Oct 2026</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span><span>3 min read</span></div>
      <div class="ins-share-row"><span class="lbl">Share</span><a href="#">LinkedIn</a><span class="sep">&middot;</span><a href="#">Email</a><span class="sep">&middot;</span><a href="#">Copy link</a></div>
    </div>
